    "Independent typed unordered bag oracle retains duplicate outer-join rows and checks nullable-side COALESCE results after further mapping.",
    "Filtered/conditional Ensure controls require correct lazy demand placement; an unexpected target failure remains a failed control.",
    "Singleton scalar control checks conditional demand; demanded multirow scalar uses the existing strict scalar-cardinality error classifier and target-request boundary check.",
    "Unused multirow scalar is a deliberate overlap with C15. Independent Q25 cannot be represented as fixing C15; preserve and separately attribute any observed C15 failure rather than admitting or deleting it.",
    "Volatile control checks exact join-result ID multiplicity, same-row alias equality and one observed shared value per duplicated producer ID. It never compares random values across executions or claims an exact invocation counter; four independent repetitions per optimizer mode are proposed."
  ],
